gsutil cp invalid.json gs://events-input/
```

## Why This Is Asked
Assesses ability to design cross-cloud, per-tenant data pipelines with strong semantics and security for fintech data.

## Key Concepts
- Streaming ingestion with Pub/Sub and Dataflow
- BigQuery exactly-once semantics via insertId; tenant isolation via datasets
- Snowflake ingestion via Snowpipe from GCS
- CMEK, IAM scoping, retries, DLQ, schema evolution

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pub/Sub message -> JSON parse and enrich (pseudo-beam-like)
function parseMessage(msg){
  const obj = JSON.parse(Buffer.from(msg.data, 'base64').toString());
  obj.ingest_ts = Date.now();
  return obj;
}
```

